  backgroundMusicClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 50d48a84842dadb4c98118bfa6de9104, type: 3}
  description: The Curse Bearers, in stark contrast to the Order of Seraphs, are
    a faction deeply entrenched in dark and demonic practices. Their elite units
    are powerful demons focused on dealing substantial damage, displaying offensive
    prowess. Unlike the Seraphs, the Curse Bearers prioritize offense over defense,
    resulting in units with lower life expectancy but formidable attacking capabilities.
    The origins of their units can be traced to the Devil's Gate, serving as a portal
    for demonic entities. This faction embraces a diabolical nature, with an emphasis
    on unleashing destructive forces in pursuit of their goals.
